{"steam_appid":1594940,"steam_name":"Little Witch in the Woods","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1594940/903812280/c0c9cb3e88fc93071d51bbc3cc3ec4d2af8602a8/1757601591/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757606391","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196265/9e5d0031786f05df7773e4b3d8a1dd3202ce3e1b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757606391","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/ss_0569cca715dc43d7e86ae11b8b8d2c84ec4a4fd3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760421411","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/3d249807f69063f01d966f1817bf766aaa91f8d9/ss_3d249807f69063f01d966f1817bf766aaa91f8d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760421411","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/623dea3c94ca66719a29abd1919e7547a5cbec3d/ss_623dea3c94ca66719a29abd1919e7547a5cbec3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760421411","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/ss_f08c07135507712c6120f7d5535238cff1cbc1cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760421411","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/eb398f215525bf35421cf5d51dcef3b5ce64d106/ss_eb398f215525bf35421cf5d51dcef3b5ce64d106.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760421411"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time To Usher In a Life As Ellie the Little Apprentice Witch!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Ellie, a dispatched apprentice witch, and experience her journey of self development at Lucerine Ortu—a land of witches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore brand-new areas, craft potions and help the villagers. A heartwarming and cozy adventure awaits you here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, gather, decorate your house, and interact with cats! We have all kinds of activities that will make every day an unforgettable experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/bb6a15ca90c666f515efdde60182dcd2.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/bb6a15ca90c666f515efdde60182dcd2.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/bb6a15ca90c666f515efdde60182dcd2.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/3512a31b9c028c09f86b89a34ca2cbe0.webp?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Activities and Explorations as a Witch</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate forests, caves, cliffs and lakes on your broom to meet adorable life forms and complete your Encyclopedia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to craft problem-solving potions, discover hidden treasures and unlock new paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/79d542a97581e8b4dc6574d0459a2e31.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/79d542a97581e8b4dc6574d0459a2e31.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/8431e613dcbd7837f9e20565987c57a8.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/8431e613dcbd7837f9e20565987c57a8.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/8431e613dcbd7837f9e20565987c57a8.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stories of the Village and Its Inhabitants</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as an apprentice witch. Help out at the village and solve problems for the villagers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the villagers as you restore the village. By establishing bonds, you can unlock their stories and even learn about their secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/157c168581e9778857d5a8ec8c6562ec.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/157c168581e9778857d5a8ec8c6562ec.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/157c168581e9778857d5a8ec8c6562ec.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collections and Home Decoration</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather recipes and materials to craft furniture, which will give your living space a personal touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and customize brooms to add extra enjoyment to your explorations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/34d1934a8770213d90047cf8c5ade0e9.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/34d1934a8770213d90047cf8c5ade0e9.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/34d1934a8770213d90047cf8c5ade0e9.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Laid-back Moments</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your peaceful free time fishing and chatting. Interact with cats to deepen your cross-species friendships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your exclusive story in this magical yet ever so relatable world!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/9d81b094493e87895bda20d1782bb635.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/9d81b094493e87895bda20d1782bb635.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/9d81b094493e87895bda20d1782bb635.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/ebd9974420ee4c0f98bdf7e28b2b237b.poster.avif?t=1760421411\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/ebd9974420ee4c0f98bdf7e28b2b237b.webm?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594940/extras/ebd9974420ee4c0f98bdf7e28b2b237b.mp4?t=1760421411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core i5 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["SUNNY SIDE UP"],"publishers":["SUNNY SIDE UP"],"release_date":"14 Sep, 2025"}